{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17529","headline":"酬裴杰秀才新樱桃 · 权德舆","name":"酬裴杰秀才新樱桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新果真琼液，来应宴紫兰。\n圆疑窃龙颔，色已夺鸡冠。\n远火微微辨，残星隐隐看。\n茂先知味易，曼倩恨偷难。\n忍用烹騂骆，从将翫玉盘。\n流年如可驻，何必九华丹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}